 €3100 - €3450 Wijchen ⏰ 40 uur Fulltime Techniek English Speaking Welder 
 Doorgroeimogelijkheden Ontwikkeling Vast contract 
 Over de functie 
Do you have experience as a welder and enjoy working on sturdy metal structures? Do you enjoy building a complete product from a technical drawing? Then this is the perfect job for you! 
As a structural welder, you'll be assembling and welding various parts for trailers. Using technical drawings, you'll ensure that all parts are assembled with precision and securely joined together. In this way, you'll contribute step by step to the construction of high-quality trailers. Your responsibilities will include: 
• Structural work and building trailer parts; 
• Welding (approximately 30% of the workweek); 
• Cutting and grinding parts; 
• Conducting ongoing quality checks. 
Working hours are from Monday through Friday from 7:30 to 16:15. 
 Jouw nieuwe werkplek 
You'll be working at a modern company in Wijchen that specializes in the development, production, and maintenance of trailers for exceptional transport. The company builds custom trailers for customers throughout Europe, fully tailored to their specific needs. 
The company has an informal and down-to-earth work atmosphere. Communication lines are short, and colleagues work closely together to ensure that every trailer is delivered to a high standard. From the initial design to the moment the trailer leaves the workshop, the customer's needs are the top priority. 
The location in Wijchen is easily accessible from Nijmegen, Arnhem, Boxmeer, and other nearby areas. 
 Dit bieden wij jou 
• A gross monthly salary between €3.100 and €3.450 (based on a 40-hour workweek); 
• The prospect of a permanent position based on good performance; 
• 25 vacation days and 13 compensatory days off per year; 
• A travel allowance of €0.23 per kilometer; 
• A good retirement plan; 
• Opportunities to take training courses and further...
